{"id": "section-body-09555", "title": "Pancreatitis", "chapterId": "chapter-ten", "blocks": [{"id": "body-09555", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading2", "text": "Pancreatitis", "runs": [{"text": "Pancreatitis"}], "level": 2, "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "1531"}}, {"id": "body-09556", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Pancreatitis is an inflammatory process in which pancreatic enzymes auto digest the pancreatic gland leading to functional and morphologic loss of the gland.", "runs": [{"text": "Pancreatitis"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "an"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "inflammatory"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "process"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "which"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "pancreatic"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "enzymes"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "auto"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "digest"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "pancreatic"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "gland"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "leading"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "functional"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and morphologic loss of the gland."}]}, {"id": "body-09558", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Acute Pancreatitis", "runs": [{"text": "Acute"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Pancreatitis"}], "level": 4, "list": {"level": 2, "numberingId": "1531"}}, {"id": "body-09559", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "It is due to sudden inflammation of the pancreas due to pancreatic enzymes auto digestion. Common risk factors which trigger the acute episode are presence of gallstones and alcohol intake.", "runs": [{"text": "It"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "due"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "sudden"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "inflammation"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "pancreas"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "due"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"